In the newer testing versions, there are also an argument 'selection',
which enables to select only a subset of each sample to be returned.
It looks like you do something like this by yourself in your code.
This does not reduce running time, but reduce the size of the R-
object.

Also 'add.names=FALSE' will reduce storage, as the names in each
sample is only given for the first sample.

H

