Hi,

this sounds a bit strange, as the AR1, for prediction with go towards
the mean, like for k-step ahead prediction, its like

	mean + (last.value -mean) * phi^k

so there is no overshoot by the AR1 itself, it has to come from the
'mean' or the 'last.value'.

I do not understand how you do the 'first year', I guess you have data
from years earlier which is used for the prediction of the first year?

H

